<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER - MULDER PULLS OUT OF DUTCH SQUAD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - MULDER PULLS OUT OF DUTCH SQUAD.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schalke '04 striker Youri Mulder pulled out of the Dutch squad for Saturday's World Cup group seven qualifying match against Wales due to an ankle injury, Dutch news agency ANP said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dutch coach Guus Hiddink, who will also be without strikers Patrick Kluivert and Rene Eykelkamp due to injuries, has not named a replacement.</p>
</text>
